Hello, I’m Alaina! I’m originally from Indianapolis but have been a resident of Florida since 2024. I earned my BSc in Molecular Biology from the University of St. Andrews in Scotland in 2026. I am currently a graduate student in the Biochemistry and Molecular Biology department within the Biomedical Sciences Master&#39;s program. I am most interested in how hosts respond to pathogens on the molecular level. Outside of the lab, I enjoy hiking, thrifting, and volunteering at my local animal shelter.



